      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Prahran (VIC 3181)**, there are several locksmiths in and around the area that install and configure digital and smart locks.\n\nSome well-reviewed options include:\n\n- ASAP Locksmiths Melbourne – Based in Windsor, offers lock installation and security upgrades.\n- Prahran Locksmith Services – 24/7 mobile locksmith servicing Prahran.\n- Magen Locksmiths – Installs and programs digital and smart locks.\n- LockCorp Locksmiths – 24/7 locksmith with experience in electronic lock installations.\n- Superior Tech Locksmiths – Specialises in lock replacement and smart lock fitting.\n\nMany Melbourne locksmiths also install brands such as Yale, Lockly, Samsung, Schlage, Aqara, and other keyless entry systems, and can usually:\n- Replace an existing deadbolt with a smart lock.\n- Install a new smart lock on compatible timber or metal doors.\n- Set up PIN codes, fingerprints, mobile apps, and Wi-Fi/Bluetooth connectivity.\n- Check door compatibility before installation. [www.newgenlocksmith.com.au](https://www.newgenlocksmith.com.au/services/smart-lock-installation/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nTypical installation pricing is often around **A$150–A$350** for labour, depending on the door, lock type, and whether you're supplying the lock yourself. If the locksmith also supplies the lock, they'll usually provide a bundled quote. [www.newgenlocksmith.com.au](https://www.newgenlocksmith.com.au/services/smart-lock-installation/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you already have a specific smart lock model (for example, Yale, Aqara, Lockly, or Samsung), let me know the model number and I can tell you whether it's likely to fit your existing door and what installation is likely to involve.",
